<title>NEW ZEALAND: Fletcher Forest sets strike price.</title>
<headline>Fletcher Forest sets strike price.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fletcher Challenge Forests said on Wednesday it had set a strike price of $2.3363 for its shares under its dividend reinvestment plan.</p>
<p>The weighted average selling price was based on prices and volumes of the shares traded in the five days following the dividend record date of October 25.</p>
<p>No discount was applied.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
